  << /ActualText (Work Experience\n\nUI\057UX Designer \046 Graphic Designer\050\nTurquoic IT Consultancy\050\nDesigned conversion\055focused landing pages\054 product interfaces\054 and digital experiences for 10\053 clients across UAE and GCC markets\056\nBuilt brand identity systems and marketing creatives aligned with client acquisition and retention goals\056\nProduced wireframes\054 user flows\054 and screen designs for web and SaaS products \024 from brief through to development handoff\056\nCollaborated with stakeholders to align UX decisions with business objectives\054 campaign performance\054 and CRO outcomes\056)
