  << /ActualText (Freelance UI\057UX \046 Brand Designer\050\nIndependent\n\nDesigned social media graphics\054 reels\054 posters\054 and promotional content across 6\053 years \024 developing a fluency in what visual formats drive engagement and action\056\nBuilt brand identity systems and visual language for scaling businesses\054 translating positioning strategy into design\056\nProduced marketing creatives and video content for client campaigns\054 with increasing focus on conversion and audience growth metrics\056\nDesigned landing pages and digital assets with lead generation as a primary brief \024 an early entry point into CRO thinking\056\nManaged full client lifecycle independently \024 discovery\054 scoping\054 design iteration\054 and delivery\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 1134 0 R
