1137 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Design Projects\n\nPaperwurk \024 B2B Compliance SaaS Platform UX Design \267 Information Architecture\nEnd\055to\055end UX design for a multi\055tenant compliance platform for UAE businesses \024 user flows\054 screen design\054 and information architecture structured across multiple user personas and permission levels\056\n\nAlya Auditors \024 Audit Readiness Platform CRO \267 Conversion Design\nDesigned a multi\055stage compliance checker and lead capture flow for a UAE audit firm \024 optimizing the conversion architecture and trust signal placement to reduce drop\055off across the conversion funnel\056\n\n4BC Global \024 MEA Research Firm Platform Brand Identity \267 Web Design\nFull brand identity system and digital platform for a specialist MEA market research and advisory firm \024 visual design\054 typography\054 layout architecture\054 and 30\053 case study library\056\n\nInsure First \024 Insurance Advisory Platform Landing Page \267 CRO \267 B2B\nMulti\055route landing platform for a CBUAE\055licensed insurance advisory firm \024 engineering a conversion\055focused UX structured to maximize qualified lead capture while balancing strict regulatory contexts for UAE and GCC audiences\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 1138 0 R
     /Pg 1111 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
